### ========================================
### USERS
### ========================================

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Buscar usuário autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Atualizar usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marcelo Cardoso Kade",
  "avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}


### Excluir usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ========================================
### PROJECTS
### ========================================

### Criar projeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DevBoard",
  "description": "Plataforma para gerenciamento de projetos."
}


### Listar meus projetos
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Buscar projeto
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Atualizar projeto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DevBoard API",
  "description": "API para gerenciamento de projetos.",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### Excluir projeto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========================================
### TASKS
### ========================================

### Criar task
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Implementar autenticação",
  "description": "Criar login e registro usando JWT.",
  "status": "TODO",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}


### Listar tasks do projeto
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Buscar task
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Atualizar task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}


### Concluir task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}


### Excluir task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========================================
### PROJECT MEMBERS
### ========================================

### Listar membros do projeto
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Adicionar membro
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "role": "MEMBER"
}


### Alterar papel do membro
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}


### Remover membro
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members/{{memberId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}